        "execSummary":  "Google\u0027s new Gemini audio stack lowers the barrier to deploying multilingual voice AI agents at production scale, which is directly relevant to enterprise customer-support operations handling global call volumes. The asynchronous function calling capability means voice agents can look up data, trigger workflows, or escalate tickets in the background without pausing the customer conversation — a meaningful operational upgrade. Integration with LangChain, LiveKit, and Pipecat reduces build complexity for enterprise teams. The watch-out: competitive pricing is attractive, but enterprises should benchmark accuracy on domain-specific vocabulary before committing to production voice pipelines.",
