        "summary":  "Google outlined its AI strategy across scientific discovery, healthcare, climate forecasting, and workforce development — including AlphaGenome Atlas mapping 9 billion genetic variations, WeatherNext 3 delivering 50% more accurate precipitation forecasts, and a $1 billion investment to skill 100+ million people globally. The article frames AI\u0027s value as a productivity multiplier that frees human experts for strategic work rather than replacing them. Support for nearly 300 languages covering 86% of the global population underscores the company\u0027s emphasis on responsible and equitable deployment.",
