        "summary":  "Anthropic launched Enterprise Frontier Safeguards (EFS), a solution combining zero data retention privacy with automated misuse detection, where customer data stays in enterprise-controlled cloud infrastructure under enterprise encryption keys — eliminating the need to add Anthropic as a trusted data vendor. The system detects patterns across sessions and accounts, flagging threats directly to customers without requiring Anthropic human review. EFS was co-developed with 100+ enterprise customers across financial services, healthcare, telecom, law, retail, and government.",
