        "execSummary":  "The arrival of GPT-6.1 Sol on Bedrock represents a meaningful shift in enterprise AI economics: near-frontier reasoning capability at roughly 80% lower cost per task than its predecessor. For enterprise AI leaders, this changes the ROI calculus on deploying advanced reasoning in high-volume workflows — document review, customer interaction triage, and code generation — that were previously cost-prohibitive at scale. The model\u0027s improved error recognition reduces a key liability in agentic deployments where mistakes compound across multi-step workflows. Caveat: enterprises with strict zero-retention data policies must proactively request this through AWS account teams rather than having it as the default.",
